    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Neutr\u00E1ln\u00ED",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u017D\u00E1dn\u00FD popis.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goar",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Tento mocn\u00FD p\u00E1n se zamlada samojedin\u00FD postavil arm\u00E1d\u011B pekeln\u00E9 a jednou rukou ji zni\u010Dil, nebo\u0165 zape\u010Detil br\u00E1nu, je\u017E vojska na tento sv\u011Bt p\u0159iv\u00E1d\u011Bla. Pot\u00E9 se stal nez\u00E1visl\u00FDm vl\u00E1dcem \u0159\u00ED\u0161e.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Asumuel",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ka\u017Ed\u00E9 d\u00EDt\u011B se t\u0159ese, zaslechne-li toto neblah\u00E9 jm\u00E9no - tento vl\u00E1dce pekel toti\u017E proslul nez\u0159\u00EDzenou krve\u017E\u00EDznivost\u00ED. Na jedn\u00E9 hostin\u011B, po\u0159\u00E1dan\u00E9 na po\u010Dest Bethrezena a jeho v\u00EDt\u011Bzstv\u00ED nad kr\u00E1lovstv\u00EDm sv\u011Btla, pr\u00FD poz\u0159el 1000 otrok\u016F.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
